    "evolution": "Final Gen1–4 forms from both existing evolution graphs; authored branches preferred; deduplicated and thematic fillers keep six choices per trainer",
    "training": "Evolved copies retain authored IV/EV/nature/K; moves/ability/item adapted through the shared strategic planner; same party size and matched/normalized levels",
    "scope": "House only; authored Adventure and Tower species remain unchanged; House still grants no XP/EV/rewards",
    "blockingCause": "UI could consume an action while clubBusy silently discarded its RPC; independently, rejected actions disabled the UI without a fresh authoritative prompt",
    "busyFix": "House canChooseAction includes the existing busy flag; no premature action button",
    "recovery": "On action/pass error or timeout, request current House state; never retry the move itself; server resumes only a valid pending choice",
    "refresh": "Mark initial sessions as already attached, so refresh does not replay the entrance; explicit resync preserves accepted actions, replacement/pivot prompts, turn and clocks",
    "lease": "Ignore RPC replies belonging to a disconnected/replaced client request epoch"
  },
